{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"unanimated-detectible-cow","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\n\nDiscovered while adding the compact-worker leg to doctor's lock census (ticket\nbemused-painted-worm / 8a0d-96ca-a60e-4da6). Snapshot GC's operation-linked trigger\n(a3da2f4cce) added a stamped worker lock at `<snapshot-store>/gc/worker.lock`\n(`rebar._snapshot.gc_trigger._WORKER_LOCK_NAME`), the same detached-background-worker\nshape as `.rebar/compact-worker.lock` — a lock most likely to be held by a process an\noperator cannot find with `ps`.\n\n`doctor_locks.scan_locks` censuses only the tracker-adjacent locks (tickets write pair,\nhlc, enrich-drain, and now compact-worker). The snapshot store is a DIFFERENT root\n(`rebar._snapshot.repo_snapshot.store_root()`, typically under the user cache dir, not the\nrepo's `.rebar/`), so adding this leg is not a one-line mirror: doctor would need to derive\nthe snapshot-store root, decide how to report a store that does not exist yet, and the lock's\nstaleness discipline (gc_trigger's own reclaim logic) may not be the shared\n`lock_owner.stamped_file_is_stale` table. That design question is why this is its own ticket\nrather than scope-creep on 8a0d-96ca.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Decide whether the snapshot-GC worker lock belongs in `rebar doctor`'s census (and if\n      so on which root/path derivation) or document why it is out of doctor's scope.\n- [ ] If added: the leg reports held-for / holder / staleness like the other stamped legs,\n      with tests for held (live + dead holder) and free/absent store.\n- [ ] If declined: the decision and rationale are recorded on this ticket and in\n      doctor_locks' module docstring.","id":"2b09-d231-2152-42d6","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"doctor lock census has no snapshot-GC worker-lock leg"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787354646844370001,"uuid":"c35aa5f9-5553-426f-8921-c8c9c4648d49"}